{
    "name": "儲物",
    "category": "tfg:logistics",
    "icon": "tfc:wood/chest/douglas_fir",
    "pages": [
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "$(li)$(bold)物品儲存$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#chests)箱子$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#crates)板條箱$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#vaults)保險庫$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#super_chests)超級箱$()$(li)$(bold)物品與流體儲存$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#ae2)ME 儲存$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#kegs)酒桶$()$(li)$(bold)流體儲存$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#barrels)木桶$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#drums)桶$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#fluid_tanks)流體儲罐$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#multiblock_tanks)多方塊儲罐$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/storage#super_tanks)超級缸$()",
            "title": "索引",
            "anchor": "index"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "title": "簡介",
            "anchor": "intro",
            "text": "在$(tfg)中，你會累積大量的物品、材料和流體。建立龐大的儲存系統來整理所有東西非常重要。儲存最重要的兩個面向是$(thing)容量$()和$(thing)限制$()。關於隨身的物品欄管理，你應該閱讀$(l:logistics/personal_storage)個人儲物$()。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "箱子",
            "anchor": "chests",
            "item": "tag:forge:chests",
            "text": "箱子可以存放 18 個物品，大箱子可以存放 36 個。箱子可以容納最大到$(l:game_mechanics/size_and_weight)大$()的物品。$(br)如果箱子裡有$(thing)食物$()，就會引來老鼠。所以最好把它們存放在$(item)小缸$()中。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "enable_visualize": false,
            "text": "$(bold)提示$()：箱子有各種木材的變體！",
            "multiblock": {
                "pattern": [
                    [
                        "Y"
                    ],
                    [
                        "0"
                    ]
                ],
                "mapping": {
                    "Y": "#forge:chests/wooden[facing=north,type=single]"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "板條箱",
            "anchor": "crates",
            "item": "tag:gtceu:crates",
            "text": "在儲物方面，GregTech 有可以容納任何尺寸物品的$(item)板條箱$()，等級越高容量越大，從 27 到 144 個欄位不等。$(br)板條箱支援$(thing)物品篩選器$()和$(thing)腐爛物銷毀覆蓋板$()等物流覆蓋板。$(br)你甚至可以用$(item)膠帶$()包住板條箱，讓它被破壞時保留內容物，方便運送大量物品。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "enable_visualize": false,
            "text": "$(bold)提示$()：木製板條箱相當便宜，很適合用來存放原木。",
            "multiblock": {
                "pattern": [
                    [
                        "X"
                    ],
                    [
                        "0"
                    ]
                ],
                "mapping": {
                    "X": "#gtceu:crates"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "保險庫",
            "anchor": "vaults",
            "item": "create:item_vault,create_connected:item_silo",
            "text": "機械動力的$(item)保險庫$()是集中存放大量物品，或為$(thing)動態結構$()增加儲存空間的好方法。$(br)保險庫可以組成大型立體結構，每個保險庫增加 20 個欄位。你無法手動放入或取出保險庫中的物品，需要使用漏斗等物品物流方式。"
        },
        {
            "type": "tfg:multimultiblock",
            "text": "$(bold)提示$()：$(item)貨櫃$()是保險庫的彩色替代品。",
            "multiblocks": [
                {
                    "pattern": [
                        [
                            "       ",
