        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "超級箱",
            "anchor": "super_chests",
            "item": "tag:gtceu:super_chests",
            "text": "超級箱和量子箱是存放數量驚人的單一種類物品的最佳方式。箱子可容納的物品數量隨等級增加，從 10,000 到 1,024,000,000 個不等。超級箱還內建物品銷毀、鎖定和自動輸出選項。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "enable_visualize": false,
            "text": "$(bold)提示$()：超級箱可以在裝有物品的情況下撿起。",
            "multiblock": {
                "pattern": [
                    [
                        "X"
                    ],
                    [
                        "0"
                    ]
                ],
                "mapping": {
                    "X": "#gtceu:super_chests"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "ME 儲存",
            "anchor": "ae2",
            "item": "ae2:drive",
            "text": "Advanced Energistics 的$(item)驅動器$()和$(item)儲存元件$()可以將你的儲存數位化，建立功能強大且高密度的物流與合成網路。連接$(item)ME 控制器$()和$(thing)終端機$()即可查看其中的物品。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "enable_visualize": false,
            "text": "$(bold)提示$()：等級越高的儲存元件可以容納更多種類的物品和更多「位元組」。",
            "multiblock": {
                "pattern": [
                    [
                        "X"
                    ],
                    [
                        "0"
                    ]
                ],
                "mapping": {
                    "X": "ae2:drive"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "酒桶",
            "anchor": "kegs",
            "item": "tag:firmalife:big_barrels",
            "text": "$(item)酒桶$()具有同時存放大量物品$(italics)和$()流體的獨特能力。$(br)酒桶可以裝木桶能裝的任何流體，最多 80,000 mB，並可以存放最多 36 組$(l:game_mechanics/size_and_weight)大$()物品。$(br2)酒桶無法像木桶一樣處理配方或熟成酒類。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "enable_visualize": false,
            "text": "$(bold)提示$()：你可以從酒桶的任何方塊自動放入和取出。",
            "multiblock": {
                "pattern": [
                    [
                        "67",
                        "45"
                    ],
                    [
                        "23",
                        "01"
                    ]
                ],
                "mapping": {
                    "0": "firmalife:wood/big_barrel/oak[facing=south,barrel_part=0]",
                    "1": "firmalife:wood/big_barrel/oak[facing=south,barrel_part=1]",
                    "2": "firmalife:wood/big_barrel/oak[facing=south,barrel_part=2]",
                    "3": "firmalife:wood/big_barrel/oak[facing=south,barrel_part=3]",
                    "4": "firmalife:wood/big_barrel/oak[facing=south,barrel_part=4]",
                    "5": "firmalife:wood/big_barrel/oak[facing=south,barrel_part=5]",
                    "6": "firmalife:wood/big_barrel/oak[facing=south,barrel_part=6]",
                    "7": "firmalife:wood/big_barrel/oak[facing=south,barrel_part=7]"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "木桶",
            "anchor": "barrels",
            "item": "tag:tfc:barrels",
            "text": "$(l:craftsmanship/barrels)木桶$()不只能用於配方。它們是儲存大量流體非常便宜的方式，每個木桶最多可以裝 10,000 mB。$(br)將木桶橫放時，它可以從水龍頭將流體滴入下方的容器，以穩定的速度自動輸出。$(br)你可以背著裝滿的木桶來運送其內容物。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "enable_visualize": false,
            "text": "$(bold)提示$()：木桶在打開並暴露於天空下時可以收集雨水。",
            "multiblock": {
                "pattern": [
                    [
                        "X"
                    ],
                    [
                        "0"
                    ]
                ],
                "mapping": {
                    "X": "#tfc:barrels[facing=up]"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "title": "桶",
            "anchor": "drums",
            "item": "tag:gtceu:drums",
            "text": "$(item)桶$()很適合用來儲存和攜帶流體。它們可以裝大量的單一種類流體，等級越高容量越大，從 32,000 到 1,024,000 mB 不等。$(br2)桶被破壞時會保留其中的流體，非常適合用來搬運流體。$(br2)手持$(thing)軟錘$()或$(thing)螺絲起子$()對桶按下$(item)$(k:key.use)$()，可以讓它自動從底面輸出流體。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "enable_visualize": false,
            "text": "$(bold)提示$()：桶的各面都可以裝上流體物流覆蓋板。",
            "multiblock": {
                "pattern": [
                    [
                        "X"
                    ],
                    [
                        "0"
                    ]
                ],
                "mapping": {
                    "X": "#gtceu:drums"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "title": "流體儲罐",
            "anchor": "fluid_tanks",
            "item": "create:fluid_tank,create_connected:fluid_vessel,fluidlogistics:multi_fluid_tank",
            "text": "$(item)流體儲罐$()可以視為$(l:logistics/storage#vaults)保險庫$()的流體版本。每個儲罐可以裝 32,000 mB，並可以組成結構來擴充容量。$(br2)$(item)多流體儲罐$()可以同時裝多種流體，但無法手動互動。"
        },
